<title>JAPAN: Seino Transport to issue Euroyen convertible bond.</title>
<headline>Seino Transport to issue Euroyen convertible bond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seino Transportation</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Daiwa Europe Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE Euroyen convertible		     AMT 20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISSU PRICE	    MATURITY 31.Mar.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 6.Jan.97   CONV TO 24.Mar.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 27.Dec.96  INT PAY 31,Mar</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE 18 Dec</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>Coupon will be decided on December 18 and the conversion price on December 17.</p>
</text>
